I2S driver for hardwired I2S setup attached to AXI stream bus.
It uses DMAEngine PCM framework.
Audio settings are fixed and set to values that were found to work well with hw.

Upstream-Status: Pending

Signed-off-by: Juan Schroeder <jcschroeder@gmail.com>

